{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personally developed game similar to <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, without the card-drawing mechanic. It features 3 maps, and the screenshots are actual in-game screen captures. The gameplay works as follows: defeat monsters to gain experience points, level up, and allocate skill points. Allocate points to reach Level 3 in each of the five elements (Gold, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth) to unlock different powerful skills. Defeat the boss that appears on the 20th wave to win the level. There is no storyline, and you can start playing immediately after launching the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066270/extras/8a35eb1adfeb19b635619bdaa5bf37ac.avif?t=1762659131\" width=1185 height=562 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066270?t=1762659131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066270/ace6351be8bc86b6a3666669adc170b2fc9f3612/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762659131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066270/84a297507d439def76a3349fc37a62f3dd3e67df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762659131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066270/84a297507d439def76a3349fc37a62f3dd3e67df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762659131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personally developed game similar to <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, without the card-drawing mechanic. It features 3 maps, and the screenshots are actual in-game screen captures. The gameplay works as follows: defeat monsters to gain experience points, level up, and allocate skill points. Allocate points to reach Level 3 in each of the five elements (Gold, Wood, Water, 